      "source": "Start listening to changes. The stream will not be completed unless the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscription</code></a>\nis <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>canceled</code></a>.\n<br/>\nHowever, the stream may become dead, or invalid, if all watched collections, databases are dropped.",
      "translation": "开始监听变更。除非 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscription</code></a>\n被 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.4-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscription.html#cancel()\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>canceled</code></a>，否则流将不会完成。\n<br/>\n然而，如果所有被监控的集合或数据库被删除，流可能会变为无效或死亡。",
      "count": 1
